  "abstract": "Gamma schedule sweep at the current best capacity: lower gamma_end to 0.95 to reduce late-horizon factor dominance. Uses oscillatory 2nd-order SSM factors, factorized loadings (k=320, p=32), residual copy head, MAE+curvature loss, and V-orthogonality (\u03bb=1e-5).",
